# slider-home-end (h8-points-slider): at center=0.123,0 the inward bounds are
# -9.77..10.02 (the prompt's -4.87/5.12 is the 500x400-fixture equivalent).
# Home sends -9.77 (mid-run URL line), End sends 10.02; the shot shows the End
# state with the tip (the track keeps focus). Behaviour: p=10.02 in the URL.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query center=0.123,0
wait 500
click 331.5 599.5
wait 200
key Tab
key Home
wait 400
key End
wait 1200
shot slider-home-end
